            <p class=3D"trend-summary">Adopting AI-native AML is becoming an =
operational necessity for banks to protect their networks from illicit flows.=
 Financial institutions must upgrade their compliance infrastructure to avoid=
 severe regulatory penalties and maintain international banking relationships=
.</p>
