            <p>He emphasized that voluntary commitments from technology compa=
nies are insufficient to protect the public from potential harms. Gates advoc=
ated for the creation of new national and international regulatory bodies ded=
icated to monitoring and governing AI development.</p>
            <p class=3D"trend-summary">As regulatory pressure mounts, financi=
al institutions must anticipate stricter oversight regarding AI-driven automa=
