            <p>China's data industry reached a valuation of 6.78 trillion yua=
n last year, as highlighted at the 2026 China International Big Data Industry=
 Expo in Guiyang. The event focused on transforming high-quality datasets int=
o the "new oil" of the AI era.</p>
            <p>The expo showcased innovative applications, such as Guizhou Wu=
jiang Hydropower's smart dispatch platform, which integrates meteorological a=
nd grid data to predict renewable energy fluctuations. This data-driven appro=
ach improved wind and solar forecast accuracy to over 91%.</p>
            <p class=3D"trend-summary">The rapid growth of the data economy u=
nderscores the value of structured, high-quality datasets for training financ=
